<title>USA: Winston files $200 mln equity shelf offer.</title>
<headline>Winston files $200 mln equity shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winston Hotels Inc filed Friday with  the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering  of up to $200 million in common shares and preferred stock.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used by the real estate investment  trust for various purposes including acquiring additional hotel assets,  repaying outstanding debt and improving properties.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
